WEBVTT

00:51.240 --> 00:53.030
I wonder if it's because

00:53.030 --> 00:54.470
the Crown Princess is expecting,

00:54.710 --> 00:57.030
but she seems much gentler today.

00:57.390 --> 00:58.070
Indeed.

00:58.240 --> 00:59.670
She's usually so reserved

00:59.670 --> 01:00.560
and so aloof.

01:01.000 --> 01:03.350
Yet today, she hasn't stopped smiling.

01:37.280 --> 01:38.280
At a time

01:38.400 --> 01:39.840
of such uncertainty,

01:41.230 --> 01:44.040
His Majesty's health
isn't what it used to be.

01:44.430 --> 01:46.200
We'll keep everything simple.

01:46.710 --> 01:49.200
Today is just a family gathering.

01:49.560 --> 01:50.350
Everyone,

01:50.464 --> 01:51.790
please make yourselves at home.

01:52.710 --> 01:55.000
Prince Lie is on duty today.

01:55.070 --> 01:55.920
Send him

01:56.280 --> 01:57.510
some dishes.

01:59.560 --> 02:00.640
That way,

02:00.928 --> 02:02.870
he can still share
in this family celebration.

02:04.070 --> 02:04.680
Come.

02:10.544 --> 02:12.550
- Thank you, Your Majesty.
- Thank you, Your Majesty.

02:12.560 --> 02:15.150
- May Your Majesty enjoy everlasting health.
- May Your Majesty enjoy everlasting health.

02:15.184 --> 02:17.776
- May you live as long as heaven and earth.
- May you live as long as heaven and earth.

02:18.000 --> 02:18.680
Come.

02:38.336 --> 02:39.910
Please continue chatting, everyone.

02:39.910 --> 02:40.960
I'll go freshen up

02:40.960 --> 02:41.870
and be right back.

02:50.680 --> 02:51.280
Your Highness!

02:57.910 --> 02:58.750
Someone, hurry!

03:01.910 --> 03:02.870
Assassins!

03:02.870 --> 03:04.360
There are assassins!

03:04.520 --> 03:06.000
Someone, hurry!

03:06.000 --> 03:08.560
Protect His Majesty!

03:25.470 --> 03:26.800
Where are the East Palace guards?

03:33.120 --> 03:33.680
Your Highness.

03:35.710 --> 03:37.400
Protect Mother and the ladies first.

03:38.680 --> 03:40.120
Qing, be careful.

03:41.800 --> 03:42.360
Tian Yuan.

03:42.370 --> 03:44.000
Escort the Crown Princess
to the side hall.

03:44.000 --> 03:44.310
Yes.

03:44.310 --> 03:45.120
I'll stay with you.

03:45.910 --> 03:46.470
Don't worry.

03:46.750 --> 03:47.590
Take care of yourself.

03:47.840 --> 03:48.430
Tian Yuan.

03:48.560 --> 03:48.960
Yes.

05:19.968 --> 05:20.780
=Blossoms of Power=

05:20.784 --> 05:23.700
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

05:23.780 --> 05:26.740
=Episode 32=

05:30.310 --> 05:30.830
Quick!

05:36.510 --> 05:37.160
Attack!

06:00.040 --> 06:00.800
Changqing!

06:00.832 --> 06:02.290
Go protect the Grand Empress Dowager!

06:04.270 --> 06:06.360
Your Majesty, your safety comes first.

06:06.800 --> 06:08.160
We should leave now.

06:32.950 --> 06:34.120
Quick, keep up!

06:42.600 --> 06:43.270
Tian Yuan.

06:43.504 --> 06:44.630
Go protect the Crown Prince.

06:44.630 --> 06:45.710
But His Highness told me...

06:45.728 --> 06:46.800
I can protect myself.

06:46.800 --> 06:47.360
Go now.

06:47.600 --> 06:48.120
Yes.

06:48.240 --> 06:48.800
Go.

07:00.352 --> 07:02.120
Although Changtai
is nowhere to be found,

07:02.120 --> 07:03.240
he harbors deep resentment.

07:03.240 --> 07:04.496
He won't let this end so easily.

07:04.528 --> 07:05.860
He's already at the end of his rope.

07:05.870 --> 07:07.420
The Imperial Guard
is heavily guarding the palace.

07:07.430 --> 07:08.720
How could anything still go wrong?

07:08.720 --> 07:10.040
It's because
he's at the end of his rope

07:10.040 --> 07:11.660
that he won't care
about the consequences.

07:11.670 --> 07:12.950
If anything happens in the palace,

07:12.950 --> 07:15.060
I'll have someone send up
a flaming arrow as a signal.

07:15.072 --> 07:16.656
You must bring the troops here at once.

07:17.390 --> 07:18.240
Rest assured, Huayong.

07:18.630 --> 07:19.270
Follow me.

07:19.750 --> 07:20.430
- Yes!
- Yes!

07:25.160 --> 07:25.560
Quick!

07:30.800 --> 07:31.800
Bar the door!

07:31.888 --> 07:32.960
Find something heavy, too.

07:32.976 --> 07:34.040
- Brace the door!
- Yes.

07:34.040 --> 07:34.480
Yes.

07:35.310 --> 07:35.950
Use this.

07:35.984 --> 07:37.168
- This one.
- Over here.

07:38.120 --> 07:39.070
Quick, help me!

07:39.070 --> 07:39.870
- Hurry!
- Here.

07:42.270 --> 07:42.920
This one.

07:43.510 --> 07:44.000
Move!

07:46.310 --> 07:47.000
Put it here.

07:47.510 --> 07:47.950
Okay.

07:52.950 --> 07:53.800
Xihe.

07:53.920 --> 07:54.430
Quick!

07:54.510 --> 07:55.800
Come stand over here.

07:55.870 --> 07:56.830
You're with child.

07:56.830 --> 07:57.950
Don't go any closer.

08:00.630 --> 08:01.360
Mother.

08:02.270 --> 08:03.560
What should we do now?

08:03.870 --> 08:05.190
Judging by what just happened,

08:05.190 --> 08:06.950
I'm afraid there's a traitor among us.

08:07.120 --> 08:08.750
They've colluded with the Palace Guard.

08:09.160 --> 08:11.190
I'm afraid they're staging a rebellion.

08:11.480 --> 08:13.600
What are we going to do?

08:15.310 --> 08:16.190
Stop crying.

08:16.480 --> 08:18.270
The guards are fighting
in the main hall.

08:18.750 --> 08:20.190
They can't spare anyone to rescue us.

08:20.870 --> 08:22.000
There is no back exit here.

08:22.390 --> 08:23.720
There's no way out.

08:24.310 --> 08:25.120
What could

08:25.920 --> 08:27.830
be more frightening than death?

08:29.390 --> 08:30.390
At a time like this,

08:30.870 --> 08:32.360
what do we still have to fear?

08:35.360 --> 08:36.360
What are you doing?

08:37.960 --> 08:38.750
These gold hairpins

08:39.840 --> 08:41.270
are usually just ornaments.

08:41.510 --> 08:42.390
But now,

08:42.832 --> 08:45.056
they can also serve as weapons
to defend ourselves.

08:46.840 --> 08:47.510
Good.

08:48.240 --> 08:49.750
Rather than sit here and wait to die,

08:50.840 --> 08:51.600
we should

08:52.270 --> 08:53.550
fight to the death.

08:57.520 --> 08:59.000
Any daughters of military families

08:59.000 --> 09:00.608
trained in martial arts, step forward.

09:01.910 --> 09:02.960
We'll hold the front.

09:03.510 --> 09:04.480
Everyone else,

09:04.490 --> 09:05.600
fall back to the rear steps.

09:05.600 --> 09:06.390
- Yes.
- Yes.

09:28.270 --> 09:29.120
Zhen Zhu, Mo Yu.

09:29.270 --> 09:30.750
Collect everyone's sachets.

09:30.910 --> 09:31.480
- Yes.
- Yes.

09:35.670 --> 09:36.150
Here.

09:38.120 --> 09:38.910
Your Highness.

09:43.720 --> 09:44.750
Keep these three.

09:44.800 --> 09:46.310
I'm going to prepare an incense blend.

09:46.320 --> 09:46.896
- Yes.
- Yes.

10:15.270 --> 10:16.030
Huayong.

10:37.150 --> 10:38.000
Father.

10:38.840 --> 10:40.240
I trust you've been well.

10:42.480 --> 10:43.440
You ungrateful son!

10:43.440 --> 10:46.150
How could you commit such a heinous act?

10:47.200 --> 10:48.200
Is there

10:48.550 --> 10:50.360
any sense of human decency left in you?

10:51.630 --> 10:52.630
Human decency?

10:53.030 --> 10:55.080
You married me off to a foreign kingdom

10:55.510 --> 10:57.080
and cut off my path to the throne.

10:57.360 --> 10:59.030
Later, after I'd let go of my obsession

10:59.320 --> 11:01.270
and Yanhui and I had fallen in love,

11:01.790 --> 11:02.960
you ordered me

11:03.670 --> 11:05.240
to treat her as an enemy

11:05.424 --> 11:08.032
and forbade me from feeling
the slightest affection for her.

11:08.910 --> 11:10.080
In your eyes,

11:10.160 --> 11:12.180
I was never anything
more than a living sacrifice,

11:12.630 --> 11:14.720
a tool without flesh or blood.

11:15.480 --> 11:18.150
When have you ever
shown me a father's love?

11:19.080 --> 11:19.960
When...

11:21.360 --> 11:23.840
When have you ever truly
loved me as your son?

11:23.840 --> 11:24.750
Shut up!

11:25.360 --> 11:25.960
I,

11:27.000 --> 11:28.870
as the Emperor of Daxing,

11:29.960 --> 11:32.030
must bear the burden of the nation.

11:32.150 --> 11:33.790
Born into the imperial family,

11:34.080 --> 11:37.360
the sovereign
always comes before the father.

11:38.080 --> 11:38.790
You,

11:39.320 --> 11:41.150
care only about
your personal grievances.

11:41.960 --> 11:43.480
When have you ever understood

11:43.480 --> 11:45.670
the burdens of being
an emperor and a father?

11:54.390 --> 11:55.270
Huayong.

11:56.440 --> 11:57.840
Open your eyes.

11:58.480 --> 12:00.510
This is our good father.

12:01.120 --> 12:03.000
All he sees is his throne,

12:03.440 --> 12:05.600
his realm, and his power.

12:05.870 --> 12:07.670
To him, we sons

12:08.270 --> 12:10.790
are nothing more than pawns

12:11.150 --> 12:13.440
to be weighed and sacrificed at will!

12:16.630 --> 12:17.440
Fine.

12:17.790 --> 12:18.550
Father.

12:19.200 --> 12:20.150
Then today,

12:20.870 --> 12:21.870
I will

12:22.440 --> 12:24.240
put an end to all of this!

12:27.840 --> 12:28.630
Huayong.

12:29.270 --> 12:31.030
Now that you know the truth,

12:31.600 --> 12:33.080
why do you still try to stop me?

12:33.240 --> 12:34.000
Changtai.

12:34.720 --> 12:35.750
If you stop now,

12:35.960 --> 12:37.000
there's still a way out.

12:37.630 --> 12:38.750
Even now,

12:39.440 --> 12:41.030
you still believe his lies?

12:41.630 --> 12:42.960
You're beyond saving.

13:50.750 --> 13:52.440
Prince Lie. I am Zhao Zhenghao.

13:52.480 --> 13:53.380
Upon seeing the signal,

13:53.390 --> 13:54.840
I came under the Crown Prince's orders

13:54.840 --> 13:56.620
with Embroidered Envoys
to rescue His Majesty.

13:56.630 --> 13:57.150
Good.

13:57.270 --> 13:57.790
Follow me.

13:58.080 --> 13:58.510
Move!

13:59.240 --> 13:59.720
Quick!

14:05.960 --> 14:06.600
Your Majesty!

14:31.550 --> 14:32.510
Guards!

14:35.790 --> 14:36.750
Your Majesty!

14:36.910 --> 14:38.080
Watch out!

14:42.630 --> 14:44.240
San Zhi!

14:51.750 --> 14:52.720
San Zhi!

15:20.550 --> 15:21.440
Huayong.

15:29.550 --> 15:30.360
Huayong.

15:32.320 --> 15:33.080
Huayong!

15:40.360 --> 15:41.030
Father!

15:50.510 --> 15:51.150
Your Highness!

15:51.240 --> 15:52.270
We can't win this.

15:52.360 --> 15:53.120
Retreat now!

15:54.240 --> 15:55.270
Huayong.

15:58.510 --> 15:59.910
Retreat!

16:02.550 --> 16:03.320
Huayong!

16:03.536 --> 16:04.720
- Your Highness!
- Huayong!

16:09.000 --> 16:09.960
Protect His Majesty!

16:10.120 --> 16:10.550
Yes.

16:12.000 --> 16:13.030
Everyone, follow me!

16:13.120 --> 16:13.840
- Yes.
- Yes.

16:29.080 --> 16:29.960
Changtai.

16:30.480 --> 16:31.360
Changtai.

16:31.790 --> 16:32.720
Stop now.

16:45.360 --> 16:46.790
For the sake of our brotherhood,

16:47.790 --> 16:48.720
I won't kill you.

16:49.152 --> 16:51.984
Go before Father
and confess your crimes yourself.

17:21.590 --> 17:22.550
Changying.

17:24.000 --> 17:25.880
I've always envied you.

17:28.200 --> 17:30.680
Although you were never
Father's favorite son,

17:33.590 --> 17:36.240
you grew up under
your own brother's protection.

17:38.880 --> 17:40.830
No wonder you're so innocent.

17:43.550 --> 17:45.400
I am Father's son, too.

17:47.160 --> 17:48.160
Yet now,

17:50.070 --> 17:51.920
I have become

17:53.200 --> 17:55.510
a traitor everyone in Daxing wants dead.

18:06.750 --> 18:08.750
When did I ever have any brothers?

18:10.240 --> 18:11.480
When...

18:13.960 --> 18:16.070
When did I ever have a father?

18:23.350 --> 18:25.160
I was nothing more than
a living sacrifice,

18:28.000 --> 18:30.310
a bargaining chip
to be weighed and traded.

18:49.750 --> 18:50.640
Yanyan.

18:54.240 --> 18:55.310
I'm coming.

18:59.830 --> 19:01.000
Changtai!

19:01.790 --> 19:02.310
Changtai!

19:58.070 --> 19:58.830
Yanyan.

20:01.880 --> 20:02.720
Yanyan.

20:09.790 --> 20:11.000
All your life,

20:12.160 --> 20:13.750
you've always yielded to me.

20:16.720 --> 20:17.790
You've suffered so much.

20:21.200 --> 20:22.880
No matter how reluctant I am,

20:24.480 --> 20:25.510
this time,

20:27.070 --> 20:28.070
I'll do as you wish.

20:43.550 --> 20:44.350
Yanyan.

20:48.720 --> 20:49.720
Yanyan.

21:25.350 --> 21:26.110
Changtai.

21:28.240 --> 21:28.960
Farewell.

21:34.590 --> 21:35.350
Huayong.

21:35.488 --> 21:37.440
I'll go find
the Imperial Physician for you.

21:37.550 --> 21:39.110
Rest here in the main hall.

21:41.024 --> 21:41.920
There's no need...

21:51.960 --> 21:53.440
I want to ask you something.

21:55.160 --> 21:55.960
Go ahead.

21:57.550 --> 21:58.720
Who was it,

22:01.200 --> 22:02.480
that poisoned me?

22:05.510 --> 22:06.830
I want to know.

22:07.440 --> 22:08.400
That person...

22:10.200 --> 22:11.720
was it really you?

22:13.400 --> 22:14.070
Huayong.

22:14.310 --> 22:14.960
Huayong.

22:26.350 --> 22:27.640
Over the years,

22:28.830 --> 22:30.440
I've suspected many people,

22:34.160 --> 22:35.960
but I never suspected you.

22:39.830 --> 22:41.510
And more than anything,

22:43.640 --> 22:44.960
I hoped it wasn't you.

22:46.590 --> 22:47.830
So today,

22:49.400 --> 22:51.310
I want to hear it from you.

22:53.920 --> 22:54.830
That person...

22:56.680 --> 22:57.720
who was it?

22:59.030 --> 23:00.680
Was it really you?

23:05.750 --> 23:06.510
Huayong.

23:09.680 --> 23:10.720
It wasn't me.

23:13.000 --> 23:14.550
I didn't poison you.

23:18.030 --> 23:20.640
I never once intended to harm you.

23:24.880 --> 23:26.750
If a single word I say is false,

23:28.070 --> 23:30.160
I'd rather die by your sword.

23:48.160 --> 23:48.880
Huayong.

23:49.920 --> 23:51.200
For more than ten years,

23:51.550 --> 23:54.030
I've searched tirelessly
for the culprit.

23:56.270 --> 23:57.440
Sadly,

23:57.960 --> 23:59.830
there's still no trace of them.

24:03.640 --> 24:04.590
Huayong,

24:05.310 --> 24:07.110
I have failed you.

24:09.440 --> 24:10.240
Huayong.

24:13.830 --> 24:14.720
Huayong.

24:18.000 --> 24:18.880
Huayong.

24:19.200 --> 24:20.110
Father.

24:29.350 --> 24:30.550
Father.

24:32.510 --> 24:33.790
I'll never forget

24:35.550 --> 24:37.070
that after I was poisoned,

24:38.510 --> 24:40.550
I was bedridden for months.

24:42.830 --> 24:44.790
Apart from attending court,

24:45.750 --> 24:47.790
you stayed in the East Palace
day and night

24:48.880 --> 24:50.000
to care for me.

24:52.440 --> 24:54.720
You held me in your arms as I lay dying

24:56.110 --> 24:57.680
and knelt at every ancestral shrine.

25:00.310 --> 25:02.270
Your fatherly love

25:03.270 --> 25:04.400
is still vivid in my mind.

25:06.880 --> 25:09.110
If not for your love,

25:10.790 --> 25:12.960
I would never have lived to this day.

25:17.350 --> 25:19.400
If you say you didn't do it,

25:22.160 --> 25:23.590
then I believe you.

25:30.590 --> 25:31.680
Huayong.

25:34.350 --> 25:35.680
My Huayong.

25:46.590 --> 25:48.350
I have failed you.

26:06.200 --> 26:07.920
Grand Empress Dowager,
are you all right?

26:08.160 --> 26:09.400
I'm fine.

26:09.480 --> 26:10.624
Where's the Crown Prince?

26:10.680 --> 26:12.368
He's been in the main hall with Father.

26:13.270 --> 26:13.790
Xihe!

26:14.750 --> 26:15.270
Mother.

27:16.030 --> 27:16.750
Huayong.

27:18.030 --> 27:19.440
What are you doing?

27:21.440 --> 27:22.400
Father.

27:24.440 --> 27:25.720
My condition

27:27.680 --> 27:29.350
is beyond cure.

27:39.830 --> 27:41.350
I beg you, Father,

27:43.400 --> 27:45.480
to grant the child in Xihe's womb

27:46.920 --> 27:48.350
the name Junshu.

27:49.030 --> 27:50.030
Junshu?

27:54.270 --> 27:55.920
This is a name reserved for an emperor.

27:57.720 --> 27:58.720
I...

28:01.350 --> 28:02.790
understand your intention.

28:04.270 --> 28:06.160
You wish to secure a safeguard

28:06.480 --> 28:08.160
for Xihe and your child.

28:13.920 --> 28:16.590
How difficult life will be

28:17.790 --> 28:20.310
for the Crown Princess
of the East Palace without her husband,

28:21.904 --> 28:24.464
and for the young heir
of the East Palace without his father.

28:28.720 --> 28:30.350
My final wish

28:32.110 --> 28:34.070
is that Xihe and our child

28:35.270 --> 28:36.830
may live in peace

28:37.750 --> 28:39.400
and be safe year after year.

28:41.030 --> 28:42.440
I beg you to grant my wish.

28:48.830 --> 28:49.720
Huayong.

28:59.880 --> 29:01.310
I promise you.

29:02.480 --> 29:04.070
Whether it's a boy or a girl,

29:04.880 --> 29:06.350
the child shall be named Junshu.

29:07.750 --> 29:09.310
Thank you, Father, for granting my wish.

29:10.680 --> 29:11.200
Come.

29:47.510 --> 29:48.640
Where are you going?

29:56.000 --> 29:57.310
To find Xihe.

30:21.200 --> 30:23.910
♪Time is like a river flowing backward♪

30:23.910 --> 30:26.540
♪The story is sketched anew♪

30:26.540 --> 30:30.180
♪The moonlight
is sewn together by the dusk♪

30:31.630 --> 30:34.400
♪The tide engulfs the lines on my palm♪

30:34.400 --> 30:37.130
♪Pushing me to converge with you♪

30:37.130 --> 30:41.610
♪Sifting for joy in a sea of sorrow♪

30:42.250 --> 30:44.890
♪I step onto this winding path♪

30:44.890 --> 30:47.230
♪What was swept away?♪

30:47.420 --> 30:51.590
♪Joy and sorrow show no emotion♪

30:52.630 --> 30:55.200
♪The clouds twist into a vortex♪

30:55.200 --> 30:57.950
♪Reaching out to touch you♪

30:57.950 --> 31:02.730
♪Only to find it's just a bubble♪

31:03.910 --> 31:06.180
♪Scene after scene of yesterday♪

31:06.180 --> 31:09.050
♪Lies between the sky and the water♪

31:09.050 --> 31:11.420
♪The stars are sinking♪

31:11.420 --> 31:14.420
♪Like a sunken vow♪

31:14.910 --> 31:17.590
♪You drifted away alone♪

31:18.220 --> 31:22.660
♪Without a single word of goodbye♪

31:23.530 --> 31:26.140
♪Leaving no room to turn back♪

31:26.140 --> 31:30.410
♪I can only stay there forever♪

31:30.410 --> 31:35.640
♪In the coming years, I'll always
remember that year, my graceful lover♪

31:35.840 --> 31:38.050
♪Love hangs on the crest of the waves♪

31:38.480 --> 31:42.450
♪Waiting for regret to swallow me up♪

32:40.300 --> 32:44.460
(Jade Terrace and Auspicious Dew)

32:48.440 --> 32:49.750
Xihe.

32:52.790 --> 32:54.590
It's so good to see you.

32:55.880 --> 32:56.590
Your Highness.

32:57.040 --> 32:58.750
Let me take you
to the Imperial Physician.

32:59.350 --> 33:00.790
Don't go, all right?

33:03.750 --> 33:05.750
I want to talk to you.

33:13.640 --> 33:15.720
I've imagined countless times

33:18.440 --> 33:20.440
what my final moments would be like.

33:22.960 --> 33:25.070
But I never imagined

33:27.510 --> 33:29.510
they would be this beautiful.

33:33.640 --> 33:35.160
The one I love

33:35.160 --> 33:36.960
is right before me.

33:40.590 --> 33:42.400
We're watching the snow together.

33:45.200 --> 33:46.310
It's beautiful.

34:01.640 --> 34:02.960
Xihe.

34:06.830 --> 34:08.960
Do you still remember

34:10.710 --> 34:13.000
the day the maple leaves
were at their reddest?

34:19.760 --> 34:21.550
After our afternoon nap,

34:23.630 --> 34:25.920
we quietly

34:27.550 --> 34:29.510
drank plum juice together.

34:37.800 --> 34:39.150
By the little window,

34:40.320 --> 34:41.960
with the gentle breeze drifting in...

34:44.550 --> 34:46.590
That simple kind of life

34:49.800 --> 34:51.840
was life's greatest blessing.

34:58.320 --> 34:59.150
Your Highness.

35:01.320 --> 35:02.840
We promised

35:06.360 --> 35:07.360
that this year,

35:10.550 --> 35:13.000
we'd watch
the maple leaves together again.

35:14.400 --> 35:15.280
Next year,

35:19.510 --> 35:21.710
we'd count
the apricot blossoms together.

35:23.150 --> 35:24.320
Year after year,

35:25.550 --> 35:26.800
we'd stay by each other's side.

35:46.190 --> 35:47.630
Xihe.

35:49.880 --> 35:51.230
I'm afraid

35:53.110 --> 35:55.190
I have to break that promise.

35:58.440 --> 36:01.760
I barged into your life,

36:03.480 --> 36:05.440
only to leave before you.

36:09.710 --> 36:10.670
I'm sorry.

36:14.070 --> 36:15.550
I only hope

36:20.190 --> 36:21.440
you'll never

36:22.670 --> 36:24.550
regret marrying me...

36:46.630 --> 36:48.440
Marrying you in this life

36:49.880 --> 36:51.070
is something I will

36:51.840 --> 36:53.030
never regret.

37:00.350 --> 37:06.060
♪Let it all go,
give my tears to the flowers♪

37:07.500 --> 37:13.400
♪Beneath my feet, eternal doom
is more than wind and sand♪

37:14.480 --> 37:20.070
♪That perfectly plotted love
hides in the clamor♪

37:21.520 --> 37:27.020
♪Between us, it's both
treacherous and flawless♪

37:28.400 --> 37:33.930
♪I want destiny,
and also tender words of love♪

37:34.330 --> 37:42.080
♪As night stains my eyes, I'll gaze
once more at the rosy clouds♪

37:42.330 --> 37:45.710
♪I have a dream
of a long wind in my sleeves♪

37:45.910 --> 37:49.270
♪My heart rises and falls,
we embrace in a sea of clouds♪

37:49.470 --> 37:52.810
♪In this eternity, you are a part of it♪

37:52.810 --> 37:56.400
♪My longing can level mountains
and cross countless rivers♪

37:56.400 --> 37:59.670
♪Drunk or sober, it's all like a dream♪

37:59.810 --> 38:03.360
♪Stars sink into my hair,
the moon slips through my fingers♪

38:03.360 --> 38:06.930
♪For how much joy
do we share this life together♪

38:06.930 --> 38:13.380
♪Withering and flourishing,
year after year♪

38:13.800 --> 38:17.190
♪I have a dream
of a long wind in my sleeves♪

38:17.190 --> 38:20.850
♪My heart rises and falls,
we embrace in a sea of clouds♪

38:20.850 --> 38:24.280
♪In this eternity, you are a part of it♪

38:24.280 --> 38:27.820
♪My longing can level mountains
and cross countless rivers♪

38:27.820 --> 38:31.070
♪Drunk or sober, it's all like a dream♪

38:31.280 --> 38:34.750
♪Stars sink into my hair,
the moon slips through my fingers♪

38:34.750 --> 38:38.290
♪For how much joy
do we share this life together♪

38:38.290 --> 38:41.450
♪Withering and flourishing,
year after year♪

38:46.940 --> 38:49.030
♪May the sand and dirt in my sleeves♪

38:49.270 --> 38:51.950
♪Become the tears
in the corner of my eyes♪

38:52.090 --> 38:55.160
♪And blossom into a flower♪

39:06.360 --> 39:07.230
What he could do,

39:07.550 --> 39:08.480
I can do as well.

39:08.630 --> 39:09.760
From beginning to end,

39:10.190 --> 39:11.710
I have always been your husband.

39:11.710 --> 39:13.150
Why was it Xiao Huayong,

39:13.150 --> 39:14.190
and not me?

39:14.480 --> 39:15.510
In this world,

39:15.510 --> 39:17.280
no one can compare to him.

39:17.280 --> 39:19.150
If even the gods refuse to save me,

39:19.280 --> 39:20.760
then I'll save myself.

39:20.960 --> 39:22.230
Shen Xihe.

39:22.230 --> 39:24.110
She will become my consort.

39:28.710 --> 39:31.650
♪I've hidden so many words♪

39:32.270 --> 39:35.070
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

39:35.940 --> 39:42.910
♪So never uncover♪

39:43.100 --> 39:45.460
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

39:46.590 --> 39:49.320
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

39:50.280 --> 39:55.620
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

39:57.380 --> 40:00.200
♪Every answer I gave♪

40:01.000 --> 40:03.850
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

40:04.640 --> 40:08.010
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

40:08.270 --> 40:11.580
♪How hard it truly was?♪

40:14.550 --> 40:17.990
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

40:18.980 --> 40:21.310
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

40:22.580 --> 40:28.340
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

40:29.750 --> 40:32.880
♪It's a shame I never could♪

40:33.330 --> 40:36.340
♪Give you a moon in return♪

40:36.450 --> 40:43.090
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

40:43.090 --> 40:46.760
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

40:47.630 --> 40:50.390
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

40:50.830 --> 40:53.960
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

40:54.400 --> 41:00.350
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

41:01.750 --> 41:05.300
♪You'll never♪

41:05.580 --> 41:15.050
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

41:41.220 --> 41:44.700
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)
